{"product_id":"so-super-stylish","title":"So Super Stylish","description":"\u003cp\u003eOctavia always hated the glossy, glitzy, fantastically fake world of Darlinham House - school of choice for loaded young wannabes. Now she`s at down-to-earth Jethro Park comprehensive, she can escape the backstabbing and the bitchiness, and finally live a normal life. Can`t she?But Octavia`s mini-break from the limelight doesn`t last. With her mother`s love-life hitting the headlines, and starlet-from-hell India Withers rocking up at Jethro Park to research a `gritty` new film role, Octavia knows that she`s heading for the biggest media feeding frenzy of her life.She may be an escapee from the A-list, but when it comes to fame, there`s nowhere to hide!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Rose Wilkins\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780330431354\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45538588950681,"sku":"9RE-9780330431354","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686bf4154fc32_So_Super_Stylish_Rose_Wilkins.jpg?v=1751910339","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/so-super-stylish","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}